{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-westmark-gmbh-gallant-spatula-sold-by-tk-maxx-2606-0324","content_id":"9f1f0313-753b-42de-9631-9e089eee8ef7","description":"Product Recall for Westmark GmbH Gallant Spatula presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"3b33e853-6662-40d8-8737-82ce32b526eb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-16T14:11:34+01:00","id":"3b33e853-6662-40d8-8737-82ce32b526eb","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-16T14:11:34+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a58d8867eb057103bd945c4/2606-0324-product-recall-Gallant-Spatula.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Westmark GmbH Gallant Spatula</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The affected spatulas present a health risk because they contain methylenedianiline at levels above the permitted limit.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by TK Maxx.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/cooking accessories - Spatulas/Scoops/Ladles</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Westmark</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected model</td>\n      <td>29352270</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected date stamp</td>\n      <td>03/25</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>4004094293573</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>Sold in TK Maxx stores between April 2025 and June 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Germany</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A black and red spatula marked with 03/25 date stamp.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_3b33e853-6662-40d8-8737-82ce32b526eb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a58d8867eb057103bd945c4/2606-0324-product-recall-Gallant-Spatula.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The affected spatulas present a health risk because they contain methylenedianiline at levels above the permitted limit. This substance may migrate into food during normal use, potentially posing a risk to consumer health.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of The Materials and Articles in Contact with Food (England) Regulations 2012 or the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by TK Maxx.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately and return it to their nearest TK Maxx or Homesense store for a refund or replacement. </p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">Product Recall - TK Maxx UK</a> or call 01923 473561.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2606-0324</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-07T17:42:48Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-07","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"t